				},
				{
					"id": 710350402,
					"content": "Alright, mister, where did you suddenly get the idea to come and fix this temple?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350403
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350403,
					"content": "Heh... Well, that's a long story...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350404
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350404,
					"content": "Back when I was pretending to be an adeptus, I gathered a lot of resources to help me keep up the act...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350405
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350405,
					"content": "But remember how I swore to do good after that adeptus taught me a lesson? Well, after I returned, I was planning to destroy all those materials of mine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350406
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350406,
					"content": "But then I had a thought... Rather than destroying all this information, wouldn't it be better to write up my code of charlatanry and share it with others?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350407
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350407,
					"content": "That way, I can help others to see through scams and cheaters...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350408
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350408,
					"content": "To my surprise, the guidebook I wrote proved helpful to a lot of people. Even the Ministry of Civil Affairs said that it was very useful.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350409
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350409,
					"content": "They even provided me with some additional scam countermeasures to add to the stuff that I'd written myself...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350410
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350410,
					"content": "To that end, they paid me a pretty hefty sum.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350411
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350411,
					"content": "Apart from that guidebook, I'm currently planning to write a book about the Vigilant Yaksha.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350412
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350412,
					"content": "Its purpose, of course, is to share the stories of the Vigilant Yaksha with as many people as possible.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350413
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350413,
					"content": "That way, I'll be able to put the folklore knowledge I possess to good use.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350414
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350414,
					"content": "As for this temple to Pervases, I discovered it while I was compiling material for this second book.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350415
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350415,
					"content": "I found sources saying that this temple was built by our forebears to remember the Yaksha, Pervases.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350416
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350416,
					"content": "But I never expected to find the temple in such a state of disrepair...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350417
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350417,
					"content": "When I returned and thought about it, I decided to fund the repair of this temple from my own pocket.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350418
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350418,
					"content": "After all, I, too, was guided back to the right path by an adeptus.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350419
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350419,
					"content": "I suppose repairing this temple can be considered atonement for my previous wrongdoings.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350420
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350420,
					"content": "Hmm... sounds genuine enough...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350421
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350421,
					"content": "#What do you think, {NICKNAME}?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350422,
						710350424
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Paimon"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350422,
					"content": "Sounds kinda genuine.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350423
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710350423,
					"content": "What do you mean \"kinda\"? I AM being genuine! One hundred percent genuine!",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350426,
					"content": "*sigh* Oh, fine, think whatever you like.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350427
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350427,
					"content": "If you don't trust me, then come back once work has started. You'll see.",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				},
				{
					"id": 710350424,
					"content": "That said, you've tried to fool us before...",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_PLAYER",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350425
					]
				},
				{
					"id": 710350425,
					"content": "But I gave all that up! I'm an upstanding citizen now! Didn't I swear to that before that adeptus?",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						710350426
					],
					"speakerTitle": "Wang Ping'an"
				}
			]
		},
		{
